# Native projects are tracked (bare workflow): android/ holds hand-written Kotlin
# — the SMS receiver, background transaction worker, notifier and home-screen
# widget — that `expo prebuild` cannot regenerate. Ignoring the whole directory
# meant a fresh clone would silently prebuild and drop all of it. Only the
# generated and machine-specific parts are ignored below.
android/.gradle/
android/.kotlin/
android/.idea/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/app/.cxx/
android/.cxx/
android/local.properties
android/app/release/
ios/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa

